# §1. Independent verification of the nullspace (GP-AUD-020 §3)

Degree ≤ 3 has 10 coefficients; the six endpoint conditions at \((\pm\tfrac12,0)\)
have rank 6: on \(\mathrm{span}\{1,X,X^2,X^3\}\) the value/\(\partial_X\)
conditions form a two-point Hermite interpolation matrix (nonsingular), and on
\(\mathrm{span}\{Y,XY\}\) the \(\partial_Y\) conditions give
\(\det\begin{psmallmatrix}1&-1/2\\1&1/2\end{psmallmatrix}=1\). Kernel dimension
\(10-6=4\), and each of \(\{Y^2,\,Y^3,\,XY^2,\,(X^2-\tfrac14)Y\}\) satisfies all
six conditions by direct evaluation. **CONFIRMED-BY-INDEPENDENT-DERIVATION.**
GP-DER-019's uniqueness sentence was false and GP-ERR-024's withdrawal is correct.

